   <Season id="(FuneralTune ^ FuneralPrayer) | GeneralFuneralPrayer | (JoyousSaturday ^ RaisingOfIncense)">
      <Section expanded="true" antiphonePitch="1">
         <Title>
            <Language id="English">Gospel Response</Language>            
            <Language id="Arabic">مرد الإنجيل</Language>
            <Language id="Coptic">Eybe vai ten]w~ou naf...</Language>
         </Title>
         
         <Comment>
            <Language id="English">
               For funerals:
            </Language>
         </Comment>
         
         <Text>
            <Language id="Coptic">
               Eybe vai ten]w~ou nak: enws e~bol enjw m~moc: je k~c~marwout w~ Pa[#c# I/#c#: je auask akcw] m~mon.                     
            </Language>
            <Language id="English">
               For this we glorify You, crying out saying, blessed are You O my Lord Jesus, for You were crucified and saved us.
            </Language>
            <Language id="Arabic">
               فلهذا نمجده صارخين قائلين مبارك أنت ياربي يسوع لأنك صُلبت وخلصتنا.
            </Language>
         </Text>
      </Section>
